          <zone h='10100' id='13' type-v2='text' w='98858' x='571' y='89100'>
            <formatted-text>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>Key Finding:</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'> Our regression model achieved a mean absolute error of 4.22 cases, compared with 4.45 cases for the previous-month forecast. The regression also achieved an R² of 0.720. This suggests regression can modestly improve next-month sales predictions, although additional testing is needed before using the model for inventory decisions.</run>
            </formatted-text>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#444444' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
